CSS classes with provideSignalFormsConfig():


- 🔥Another nice feature of signal forms is the ability to automatically apply CSS classes to fields
    based on their state.

- 🔥This is done by providing a configuration using the provideSignalFormsConfig() function:

    app.config.ts:

        provideSignalFormsConfig({
            classes: {
                'is-invalid': field => field.state().invalid() && field.state().touched()
            }
        })

    In this example, 😮we automatically add the is-invalid CSS class to any field that is invalid
    and touched.